<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 02 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 02 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $457.34 billion in the week to January 02 from $673 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     16.55		29.50</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues	8.50		15.26</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  440.79	     643.89</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     76.65	     126.67</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	319.43	     492.60</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    137.91	     180.79</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
